    Disable editor button in paella player (#6480)
    
    The player shows an editor button in the top right corner of external
    embeddings, if this feature is enabled and the user has right permission
    on the video. This allows users to edit the video in iFrames, which in
    my opinion is not intended.
    
    Example in Stud.IP-Courseware:
    
    
    ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a100ed1-206e-4036-bc99-074abef71db7)
    
    
    
    This patch disables the editor button.
    
    
